flowchart TD
    A[TSA National Email Enquiry] -->|Ingest Email| C(Validate Signature)
    B[LBA Website Application] -->|Web Form| C
    C --> E{Check if Duplicate}
    E -->|Duplicate| F{Check is in Scouting}
    E -->|New| G(Determine Section)
    F -->|Not in Scouting| G
    F -->|In Scouting| H((End))
    G --> I{Has Weekly Availability}
    I -->|Availability Known| J(Determine Sort Order)
    I -->|Availability Unknown| K(Send Email to determine availability)
    K --> J
    J -->|Send Email| L(Offer YP to Leaders)
    L --> M{Leader Response}
    M -->|Leader Accepts| N(Import into OSM)
    M -->|Leader Rejects| O(Next Section in Ordered List)
    O --> L
    N --> P(Create Transfer)
    P --> Q{Await Transfer}
    Q --> R(Record Outcome)
    R --> S((End))